{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組一般選舉早上9時開始投票。截至中午12時，投票率83.03%， 4740 名選民投票。<br/>\n<br/>\n其中商界（第三）投票率最高，有100%，界別內的113名選民已全部投票。其次是科技創新界。<br/>\n<br/>\n投票率最低是社會福利界，有53.37%，87人已投票，界別選民人數有163人。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T04:43:12.850638+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T04:14:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T08:57:31.780919+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T04:36:46.157365+00:00","content_hash":"2d61696a9f0ec127f6444c28499b13d0c6f6f9a66fd78cd907b882c51954dff8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}